Subject: [202605] Read AS7326 and AS7726 PSU capacity from hardware

Backported from ITJamie/sonic-buildimage accton-fixes commit 25e1c0590f93cd6a7e44c134d0c5e77e65e2e9b3.
Verified target source: 5ef9e45ccf7f004fb07bf3f9be2f471cf00573bf.

Register MFR_POUT_MAX (0xa7) on each PSU interface and expose manufacturer
capacity through both capacity APIs using the existing PDDF mW-to-W conversion.
FSF019-611 hardware returned 650 W on all four inspected supplies; no fixed
650 W or 1200 W fallback is introduced. Preserve existing input telemetry,
voltage/temperature limits, LED mappings, BIOS inventory and dependency pins.
Includes earlier changes to these JSON and PSU files for reliable reapplication.

Upstream PR: https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/pull/30780
Remove when the target branch provides equivalent fixes.

